            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.2.2+ISA.2.3+ISA.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 2:2-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu misi y’iherezo umurwa wubatswekw ingoro y’Uhoraho uzotsimbatara ku mpinga y’umusozi, ushirwe hejuru y’ iyindi mirambi; kand’ amoko azosendanisha aja kuri wo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahanga menshi azojayo, abarirane, ati Ni muze tudūge, tuje ku murwa w’Uhoraho, mk ngoro y’Imana ya Yakobo, kugira ngw itwigishe ivy’ inzira zayo, natwe tuzigenderemwo; kukw i Siyoni ari ho hazova ivyagezwe, n’i Yerusalemu hakava ijambo ry’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yow 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azocira imanza amoko menshi, ahane amahanga akomeye ya kure; inkota zabo bazozivunjavunja bazicuremw’ amasuka, n’amacumu bazoyavunjavunja bayakūremw’ inkero;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "inkero ni zo nyabuhoro.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nta hanga rizobangurira irindi hanga inkota, kandi ntibazokwiga kurwana ukundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 4:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 1:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ umuntu wese azokwībēra musi y’umuzabibu wiwe no musi y’umusukoni wiwe; kandi nta wuzobakanga: kukw akanwa k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo ari ko kabivuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 10:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ayandi mahanga yose azogenda, ihanga ryose rigendere mw izina ry’imana yaryo, ariko tweho tuzogendera mw izina ry’Uhoraho Imana yacu gushitsa ibihe bitazoshira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
